        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "大概 + proposition",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "大概 can mark an uncertain estimate about a proposition, not only an approximate number. It weakens certainty rather than asserting the opposite.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他大概在家。",
                "pinyin": "tā dàgài zài jiā 。",
                "meaning": "He is probably at home.",
                "audio": "d7a40ba6a059726703a3eaba528ffba3420a86db8dad5feda3b988791689d83a"
              },
              {
                "text": "明天大概会下雨。",
                "pinyin": "míngtiān dàgài huì xiàyǔ 。",
                "meaning": "It will probably rain tomorrow.",
